# Mechanic: Phyrexian mana in an activated ability cost ({3}{W/P}).
# Forcing: Four Plains can pay the whole cost, so paying 2 life is reachable only through the player's choice.
# Failure modes: All four Plains tapped with no choice offered means the activation used automatic payment.
# Card roles: Mite Overseer supplies the {W/P} activation. Libraries prevent draw losses.
# Protocol path: Activate, CastingTimeOptionsReq ManaType, selected payment, Mite token on the battlefield.
